+# Anthropic retired models (Sonnet 3.5 and others)
+
+Anthropic **retired** `claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022` (and the June 2024 3.5 Sonnet snapshot) on **2025-10-28**. Requests to those IDs return `not_found_error` and do not show on the Usage page.
+
+## Recommended replacement
+
+| Retired model | Use instead |
+| --- | --- |
+| `claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022` | `claude-sonnet-4-6` |
+| `claude-3-5-sonnet-20240620` | `claude-sonnet-4-6` |
+| `claude-3-7-sonnet-20250219` | `claude-sonnet-4-6` |
+
+On **OpenRouter / Nous**, prefer `anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6`.
+
+## Fix Hermes config
+
+```bash
+./scripts/audit-retired-anthropic-models.sh
+hermes config set model.default claude-sonnet-4-6   # direct Anthropic API
+# or
+hermes config set model.default anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6   # OpenRouter
+```
+
+Hermes **4.x+** also rewrites known retired IDs at request time and logs a warning — update config so you are not depending on the rewrite.
+
+## Other places to check
+
+- **Cursor** → Settings → Models (custom model name or override URL body)
+- **CI / cron** jobs that set `ANTHROPIC_MODEL` or pass `--model`
+- Application logs: search for `claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022`
+
+Official table: [Anthropic model deprecations](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations).
-- 
